  "body": "> **Stacked on #235** (#197, same Stock page). A fork branch cannot be a PR base on this repo, so this PR targets `main` and also carries #235's commit `3a0b564`; **review only the last commit, `4c1b1d4`**. Once #235 merges, this diff shrinks to that commit alone.\n\n## What changed\n\nRequested in #198: for box stock with a relative size, allow a stock allowance per side.\n\n- `camcraft_geometry::stock::fit_box_sides(bounds, [-X, +X, -Y, +Y, bottom, top])`: a box whose every face stands its own allowance off the models (XY centre between the padded faces, bottom at `min.z - bottom`); `None` for a negative or non-finite allowance or a degenerate box. Equal sides read exactly as `fit_box(margin)`.\n- Stock page (box only): a **Per side** checkbox swaps the single \"Fit margin\" for six fields; Fit to Models then sends the new `CommandKind::StockFitSides { sides }`, refused by name (\"every side's allowance must be zero or more\") before any world read.\n- `StockFit` and `StockFitSides` now share `State::apply_stock_fit` (the stock's rotation kept, the undoable `SetStock`) - the old StockFit body, moved, not changed.\n- Cylinders keep the single margin. Decision recorded in `RECOMMENDED.md` (#198).\n\n## Gate (own worktree build)\n\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-geometry`: green.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui`: every binary green (including `shell`'s 19 StockFit tests) except the lib's `egui_shell_snapshot_light` (Diff 1) and `tool_editor_snapshot` (Diff 4) - software-GL diffs with the same counts on main on this machine.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test commands_undo`: green.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-geometry -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `geometry::stock::tests::a_box_fits_each_side_by_its_own_allowance`\n- `geometry::stock::tests::a_negative_or_broken_side_allowance_is_refused`\n- `egui_app::tests::stock_fit_sides::a_box_is_fitted_by_each_sides_allowance_and_undoes` (the command, a refusal that changes nothing, undo)\n- `egui_app::tests::stock_fit_sides::the_stock_page_offers_per_side_fields_for_a_box`\n\nChangelog: Box stock can be fitted to the models with a separate allowance per side (-X, +X, -Y, +Y, bottom, top)\n\nOutside contributor PR (fork) - feat, merges at the next cut, after #235.\n\nFixes #198\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
